### GET users
GET http://localhost/users
Accept: application/json

### GET user
GET http://localhost/user/999
Accept: application/json

### GET name
GET http://localhost/name?id=999
Accept: text/plain

### DELETE user
DELETE http://localhost/user/999
Accept: text/plain

### REGISTER user
POST http://localhost/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Accept: text/plain

name=Сергей Сидоров&email=sidorov@example.my&phone=792812345678&pass=qwerty

### LOGIN user
POST http://localhost/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Accept: text/plain

email=sidorov@example.my&pass=qwerty

### FORGOT password
POST http://localhost/forgot
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Accept: text/plain

email=sidorov@example.my

### OTP for password
POST http://localhost/otp
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Accept: text/plain

email=sidorov@example.my&otp=794201

### SET NEW password
POST http://localhost/password
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Accept: text/plain

email=sidorov@example.my&pass=qwerty

###